# SIH26155 — Part 1 Requirement Traceability

Scope: INGESTION → VENDOR DETECTION → BLOCK PARSING → DETERMINISTIC PARSING →
AI INTERPRETATION → SECURITY BASELINE MODEL → PROVENANCE → UNKNOWN
CONFIGURATION PIPELINE, per the Part 1 task brief. Parts 2/3 (compliance
decisioning, deployment/remediation) are explicitly out of scope and
untouched.

Status values used below: **DONE** (implemented + test-verified this pass),
**PRE-EXISTING** (already correct before this pass, verified not re-broken),
**PARTIAL** (some coverage, gap noted), **OPEN** (not addressed this pass).
Nothing here is marked DONE without a passing test backing it — per the
brief's own anti-fabrication requirement (section 12), this doc does not
claim more than what was actually run.

